{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月23日，針對比亞迪Ti7車型被禁止在歐盟銷售，比亞迪方面回應稱，對該判決持有強烈異議，並將依法提起上訴。Ti7車型系比亞迪自主獨立設計成果，未侵犯積架路虎的任何權利。比亞迪將通過相關法律途徑，堅決維護自身合法權益。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587676.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.878190+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:36:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_hash":"092bdc23cbb55a6964328c62c9130b1d82e9f9839ea40b83c75d41012f0f71e6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}